  data: {
    LLM: "Identify the Trumps on the board. If the Jack is buried face down, try to dig for it. If it's visible on opponent's side, force them to use it on a low card if possible.\n\nBlocking: Don't play a face-up card if it uncovers a card you suspect is useful to the opponent.\n\nCard Counting: You know 12+4=16 cards of your own, plus 6 of opponent's = 22 cards visible. Only 10 are hidden. Deducing the opponent's hand is trivial.",
    Player: "Identify the Trumps on the board. If the Jack is buried face down, try to dig for it. If it's visible on opponent's side, force them to use it on a low card if possible.\n\nBlocking: Don't play a face-up card if it uncovers a card you suspect is useful to the opponent.\n\nCard Counting: You know 12+4=16 cards of your own, plus 6 of opponent's = 22 cards visible. Only 10 are hidden. Deducing the opponent's hand is trivial.",
